  "Question": "What is the least common denominator of the algebraic fractions \\(1/(x-1)\\), \\(1/(x^2-1)\\), and \\(1/(x+1)\\)?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\((x-1)(x+1)^2\\)",
    "B": "\\((x-1)^2(x+1)^2\\)",
    "C": "\\(x^2-1\\)"
